# Fanvue automation

Current state: about **1 subscriber**. First milestone: **10 subscribers**.
Never plan around $1M/month or a 90-day empire. Build for the current phase
plus one phase ahead.

Read `config.yaml` for `phase`. If missing, assume Phase 0.

## Growth ladder (do not skip)

| Phase | Focus | Subs target |
| 0 Now | Auth, upload content, post teasers | 1 → 10 |
| 1 Month 1 | ContentAgent + ChatMate + MoneyBot, daily posts | 35–70 |
| 2 Month 3 | Daily PPV, Reddit/TikTok teasers | 200–400 |
| 3 Month 6 | Tiered pricing, custom content | 600–1,000 |
| 4–5 | Full automation, extra personas | 1,500+ |

Phase 0 revenue target is **$5/mo**, not $1,000,000.

## 24-hour priority

1. Fix Fanvue OAuth end-to-end
2. Upload up to 20 images into the vault
3. Post 5 teasers (`followers-and-subscribers`)
4. Enable ChatMate + MoneyBot only after phase is 1

## Agents (Python, `fanvue-automation/`)

1. ContentAgent — first
2. ChatMate — DMs convert; do not build TrafficAgent before this
3. MoneyBot — PPV / welcome messages; no mass PPV under 5 subs
4. TrafficAgent — phase 2+
5. AnalyticsAgent — scoreboard only in phase 0 (subs, followers, posts)

All API calls go through `fanvue_client.py`. Agents are idempotent.
Log to `fanvue-automation/logs/YYYY-MM-DD_agentname.log`.
Keep `run_daily.bat` / `run_all.bat` (Windows cmd, not Python).

## Forbidden

Paid ads before organic traction, NFT/merch/SaaS-for-others, swallowing
auth errors, or deleting `.bat` files.
